<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian Pharmaceutical July sales record.</title>
<headline>Australian Pharmaceutical July sales record.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical wholesaler Australian Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd (API) said on Monday it achieved nearly A$90 million sales for the month of July, a record performance for the group.</p>
<p>On July 10, the group reported a net profit of A$23.94 million for the year to April 30, struck on A$855.54 million sales. The company listed on the Australian Stock Exchange on June 16.</p>
<p>By 3.45 p.m. (0545 GMT), API shares were steady at A$2.48 on turnover of 24,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
